&lt;h3 class="smt_head2" style="padding-left:0pt;"&gt;３ 【設備の新設、除却等の計画】&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.5pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:PlannedAdditionsRetirementsEtcOfFacilitiesTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:TotalNumberOfSharesTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h5 class="smt_head4" style="padding-left:13.5pt;"&gt;① 【株式の総数】&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:1pt;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:13.5pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
